# Cloudflare Pages header rules for the assets origin (DEPLOYMENT.md "Static
# assets on Cloudflare Pages"). Copied verbatim into dist/ by the Vite build;
# Spring serves it harmlessly at /_headers when assets stay same-origin.
#
# The store SPA serves from /assets/* and the monitor SPA from
# /monitor/assets/* — one Pages project, one domain (assets.infinia.fyi);
# whichever subtree a deployment carries, BOTH rules must ship so the other
# SPA's cross-origin module/font loads never lose CORS.
/assets/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
/monitor/assets/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
